# Real screenshots only

When a PR, review, or docs need pictures of the product UI:

- Capture **real** screenshots from a running build (local or deployed) via the browser.
- **Never** use AI-generated mockups, Illustrator-style fakes, or invented branding/icons.
- If the app cannot be run to capture a screen, omit pictures and say so—do not substitute generated images.
- Delete any previously committed fake screenshots rather than leaving them in the PR.
